operative, C 100% reliable, creates positive atmosphere, makes correct decisions quickly. Also note C's communication difficulty and egocentric, but crew atmosphere positive suggests cooperation. Might outweigh B's uncooperative.\n\nThus we can vote for Candidate C.\n\nWe must include METADATA_JSON with vote.\n\nProceed."}
